{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52728","headline":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 三 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"女，四星如箕主嫁娶。\n十二诸国在下陈，先从越国向东论。\n东西两周次二秦，雍州南下双鴈门。\n代国向西一晋伸，韩魏各一晋北轮。\n楚之一国魏西屯，楚城南畔独燕军。\n燕西一郡是齐邻，齐北两邑平原君。\n欲知郑在越下存，十六黄星细区分。\n五个离珠女上星，败瓜珠上瓠瓜生。\n两个各五瓠瓜明，天津九个弹弓形。\n两星入午河中横，四个奚仲天津上，七个仲侧扶筐星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}